(sp (make-wff '(FORALL x (IMPLIES (IN x RR) (FORALL cm (IMPLIES (IN cm RR) (FORALL y (IMPLIES (IN y RR) (FORALL cn (IMPLIES (IN cn RR) (FORALL cb (IMPLIES (IN cb RR)
